NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001023 "specifies number of results regardless of ranks while C<num_ranks> (C<-N> option)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001024 "returns number of ranks. For example, if sorting is by reverse size and if"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001025 "C<num_results> is set to 1 and there are 2 files with the same largest size then"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001026 "only 1 of those files will be returned. With C<num_ranks> set to 1, both files"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001027 "will be returned because are they both rank #1."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001028 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001029 "=item * B<num_results> => I<uint>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001030 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001031 "Number of results to return."
