NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001039 "Only include files of certain type."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001040 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001041 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001042 "=back"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001043 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001044 "Returns an enveloped result (an array)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001045 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001046 "First element ($status_code) is an integer containing HTTP-like status code"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001047 "(200 means OK, 4xx caller error, 5xx function error). Second element"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001048 "($reason) is a string containing error message, or something like \"OK\" if status is"
