NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001050 "element (%result_meta) is called result metadata and is optional, a hash"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001051 "that contains extra information, much like how HTTP response headers provide additional metadata."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001052 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001053 "Return value:  (any)"
