NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001149 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001150 "Returns an enveloped result (an array)."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001151 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001152 "First element ($status_code) is an integer containing HTTP-like status code"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001153 "(200 means OK, 4xx caller error, 5xx function error). Second element"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001154 "($reason) is a string containing error message, or something like \"OK\" if status is"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001155 "200. Third element ($payload) is the actual result, but usually not present when enveloped result is an error response ($status_code is not 2xx). Fourth"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001156 "element (%result_meta) is called result metadata and is optional, a hash"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001157 "that contains extra information, much like how HTTP response headers provide additional metadata."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001158 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001159 "Return value:  (any)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001160 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001161 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001162 ""
