NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001555 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001556 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001557 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001558 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001559 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001560 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001561 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001562 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001563 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001564 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001565 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001566 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001567 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001568 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001569 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001570 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001571 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001572 ""
